   "title": "当前做法与问题",
   "html": "<div class='callout'><p><b>专业问题：</b>泄漏信号与正常调泵扰动可能相似。</p><p><b>输入资料：</b>首末站压力、流量与时间戳。</p><p><b>服务目标：</b>用双通道证据提示泄漏并估计位置。</p></div><svg viewBox='0 0 720 250' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='负压波传播与定位原理'><defs><marker id='arT1a' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' refX='5' refY='3.5' orient='auto'><path d='M0,0 L7,3.5 L0,7 Z' fill='#b05a51'/></marker><marker id='arT1b' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' refX='5' refY='3.5' orient='auto'><path d='M0,0 L7,3.5 L0,7 Z' fill='#9ba3a9'/></marker></defs><text x='20' y='22' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#202b38'>负压波：破口产生的「稀疏波」向两端奔跑</text><rect x='40' y='96' width='640' height='26' rx='13' fill='#41699b' fill-opacity='.12' stroke='#41699b' stroke-opacity='.4'/><rect x='28' y='82' width='58' height='54' rx='6' fill='#e9eef5' stroke='#41699b'/><text x='57' y='106' font-size='9.5' font-weight='600' fill='#41699b' text-anchor='middle'>首站</text><text x='57' y='120' font-size='8.5' fill='#52627a' text-anchor='middle'>P₁ Q_in</text><rect x='634' y='82' width='58' height='54' rx='6' fill='#e7f0fb' stroke='#2875c7'/><text x='663' y='106' font-size='9.5' font-weight='600' fill='#2875c7' text-anchor='middle'>末站</text><text x='663' y='120' font-size='8.5' fill='#52627a' text-anchor='middle'>P₂ Q_out</text><circle cx='250' cy='109' r='6' fill='#b05a51'/><text x='250' y='140' font-size='9.5' font-weight='600' fill='#b05a51' text-anchor='middle'>破口 x</text><line x1='236' y1='103' x2='130' y2='103' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-width='1.6' marker-end='url(#arT1a)'/><line x1='264' y1='103' x2='360' y2='103' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-width='1.6' marker-end='url(#arT1a)'/><text x='170' y='94' font-size='8.5' fill='#b05a51' text-anchor='middle'>t₁ = x / a</text><text x='330' y='94' font-size='8.5' fill='#b05a51' text-anchor='middle'>t₂ = (L−x) / a</text><line x1='40' y1='62' x2='250' y2='62' stroke='#c9d4e4' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='250' y1='62' x2='680' y2='62' stroke='#c9d4e4' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><text x='57' y='56' font-size='8.5' fill='#41699b'>P₁ 4.5 MPa</text><text x='663' y='56' font-size='8.5' fill='#2875c7' text-anchor='end'>P₂ 3.1 MPa</text><text x='250' y='54' font-size='8.5' fill='#64748b' text-anchor='middle'>沿程压力坡降</text><rect x='40' y='164' width='340' height='70' rx='6' fill='#fff' stroke='#dfe6f0'/><text x='52' y='182' font-size='10' font-weight='600' fill='#202b38'>定位公式</text><text x='52' y='202' font-size='12' fill='#b05a51' font-family='monospace'>x = L/2 + a·(t₁−t₂)/2</text><text x='52' y='222' font-size='8.5' fill='#64748b'>a ≈ 1000—1200 m/s（油品声速）· 两站对时误差 1 s ≈ 定位差 500 m</text><rect x='400' y='164' width='280' height='70' rx='6' fill='#f6ebe1' stroke='#d47a3a' stroke-opacity='.4'/><text x='412' y='182' font-size='10' font-weight='600' fill='#d47a3a'>两个「看不见」</text><text x='412' y='200' font-size='8.5' fill='#52627a'>① 渗漏 &lt;1%：压降 &lt; 噪声，负压波法失明</text><text x='412' y='216' font-size='8.5' fill='#52627a'>② 工况扰动：压力波动与泄漏同貌</text><text x='412' y='230' font-size='8.5' fill='#52627a'>→ 需要第二条独立通道互相印证</text></svg><div class='figcap'><b>专业原理示意</b><span>用于解释业务概念和空间、参数关系；图中数字与对照为教学示意，不是现场成果。</span></div>"
