   "html": "<p>本地演示无需接入现场。下面的数据清单用于说明这一业务的资料要求，不表示项目已取得这些实测资料。</p><p>检测本身无需逐点标注——它本质是「无监督异常检测 + 物理机理」；真正要花力气的是<strong>对时</strong>、<strong>计量标定</strong>和<strong>事件台账</strong>：负压波定位对两站时钟同步极其敏感，流量计漂移会伪装成渗漏。</p><div class='checklist'><div class='cl-head'><span>数据准备清单 · 4 项</span><span class='cl-prog'><span id='cl-txt'>0 / 4</span><span class='cl-bar'><i id='cl-fill'></i></span></span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='0'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>压力、流量、温度</span><span class='cl-s'>秒级，全线多站同步采集</span></span><span class='cl-n'>无需逐点标注，需对时与去噪</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='1'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>泄漏事件台账</span><span class='cl-s'>位置、时间、漏量，单管线数十起</span></span><span class='cl-n'>报警真值与回测基准</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='2'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>工况操作记录</span><span class='cl-s'>调阀、启停泵、清管作业</span></span><span class='cl-n'>用于剔除误报（闸门依据）</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='3'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>对时与仪表台账</span><span class='cl-s'>GPS 对时偏差、流量计精度</span></span><span class='cl-n'>门槛：时差 1 s ≈ 定位差 500 m</span></div></div>"
